window.products.push({"id":511003,"name":"LOVO Fragrance of Provence Lavenders Bedding Set 1x Flat Sheet, 1x Fitted Sheet 2X Pillowcases Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A5lLXM42L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Specifications Including: Flat sheet*1, Fitted sheet*1, Pillowcase*2  This set does NOT include the comforter.   This beautiful luxury bedding set, revamps up your bedroom with fresh patterns, cool style designs & vibrant colors. 100% Egyptian-Equivalent Cotton Egyptian- equivalent cotton comes from the northwestern China; its plants grow up in high plain with the all-year-round nourishment of strong sunshine.  Such a good quality makes this comforter set more breathable and comfortable. Brushed Brushed fabrics provides a softer and more comfortable touch for you. The fewer interlacings in twills allow the yarns to move more freely, and thus they are softer and more pliable, and drape better than plain-weave textiles. Twills also recover from wrinkles better than plain-weave fabrics do. When there are fewer interlacings, yarns can be packed closer together to produce high-count fabrics. Soil and stains are less noticeable on the uneven surface of twills than on smooth surfaces, such as plain weaves. Dual Sides Reactive Dyeing Reactive dyeing is different from regular dyeing technique; it uses methanol-free dyeing materials that distill from plants. Brand Story LOVO originally began in 1992 and it is the NO.1 home textile company in China with a nationwide network of over 3,000 brand-franchised stores, covering all provinces, cities and autonomous regions in the Chinese Mainland. The company also reaches an international market through its online store . And you can also find our products on official website.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81A5lLXM42L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOVO","source_asin":"B018U3XLD6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511003","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018U3XLD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018U3XLD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
