window.products.push({"id":511045,"name":"Lunch Box, STNTUS Lunch Bag, Insualted Lunch Box for Men Women, Leakproof Cooler Bag, Adult Lunchbox for Meal Prep, Large Lunch Tote with Dual Compart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q3VT5WEWS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Durable Construction: STNTUS lunch bags keep the shape well. The outer fabric is made from waterproof nylon which is very durable and abrasion resistant. The lining is made from PEVA which create a healthier lifestyle for you and your family. Premium reinforced metal dual zippers for easy opening and secure zipper closure to prevent rips and ensure maximum durability. Heavy duty construction build for long-lasting. Double Deck Insulation: Two separate insulated compartments allow you pack hot food and cold food separately for hours until it’s time to eat. On the bottom you can pack \"dinner\" with a cool pack, and on the top you can pack \"lunch\" which may be something hot. No worry anymore about what order to place everything in since the hot and cold won't mix anymore. With thick permanent foam interlining and insulated PEVA lining to improve the insulation. Leakproof & Easy-cleaned: Bottom section is leakproof design, no worry of spills and leaks anymore. The soft PEVA lining and outer fabric are water resistant and stain resistant. Easy for you to load and unload with the wide open design. If your sauce spills inside, just a wipe with damp cloth and it’s good as new. No more waste time on cleaning to improve your to-go daily life. Spacious & Numerous Pockets: Features two zippered main compartments, down deck with 25×18×13 cm, top deck with 25×18×11 cm, fits for tupperware and some snacks or 2 of 1000 ml large lunch prep containers and an some fruits. Front zipped pocket and side pockets that allows you to store extra stuffs. Powerful organization ability to fit your lunch and dinner for the entire day! Besides, hassle-free refund is provided. Multiple Carry Options: Comes with a detachable shoulder strap gives an alternative carry option which could be adjusted from 83 to 140 cm (34 to 68 when carrying). The padded soft handle ensures comfortable carry, and the added buckles to provide extra durability. Make it a versatile choice for men and women to pack food and drinks to work, school, picnics, beach, road trips, camping, traveling or any outdoor activities.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Q3VT5WEWS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STNTUS INNOVATIONS","source_asin":"B08T1ZY8ZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511045","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T1ZY8ZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T1ZY8ZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
