window.products.push({"id":511077,"name":"Boba Cup Reusable Bubble Tea Cup Smoothie Cups, 18Oz Glass Boba Tumbler with Lids & 2 Angled Straw, Silicone Sleeve, Leakproof Drinking Bottle Juicing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KMDZFa9yS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DURABLE & LEAKPROOF BOBA KIT: If you're looking for ultimate bubble tea experience, Qinline 18Oz Reusable Boba Cup will be a surprise for you or any bubble tea super-fan. Made of durable, BPA free, food grade material, the set includes 18oz hand-blown borosilicate glass bubble tea cup with silicone sleeve & coaster, 2 stainless steel rainbow straws in 2 width with silicone tip for boba or drinks, 1 straw brush & 1 straw bag. Leakproof & airtight seal with silicone ring & stopper, no more spills! DUAL OPENING & BOBA SIZED: Qinline reusable smoothie cups owns 3 1/2” wide opening for easy pouring. Our glass boba cup tumbler with lid and straw has a pratical lid with dual opening, a large size hole with silicone stopper that perfectly fits a wide straw for boba pearls and a splash-proof sip opening for morning coffee or other drinks. The wide angled straws(12mm diameter) is perfect for sipping pearls easily in bubble tea and also great for smoothies. LARGE CAPACITY & USER-FRIENDLY: Large capacity of 18oz/530ml is a standard boba tea cup size offered in most boba stores and also effortlessly fits most iced coffee. Designed ergonomically, the Reusable Bubble Tea Cup fits perfectly in your hand and standard car cup holders. Anti-slip Silicone sleeve for better grip and silicone coaster protect your hand and cup. Silicone Tips on straw protects your lips and teeth, no taste of metallic any more! Dishwasher safe and easy to clean. PORTABLE & MULTIFUNCTIONAL: Portable to carry around in bag or car cup holder, the 18oz glass water tumbler drinking bottle with beautiful silicone sleeve in eye-catching color can be your portable go-to everyday mug for travel, on-the-go, school, office, work, shopping, picnic, etc. Perfect for boba tapioca pearls, bubble tea , water, smoothies, iced coffee, juices, milkshakes, protein shakes and more drinks. Enjoy your boba tea, coffee or drinks with our stylish cup in sunshine mood. GORGEOUS ENVIRONMENT-FRIENDLY CHRISTMAS GIFT: Our glass boba cup with metal straw can replace a lifetime of single-use plastic boba cups and straws. Together we can end single-use plastics, join us to save our planet, and enjoy guilt-free & waste-free bubble tea with reusable smoothie cups. Pick one for yourself or as gifts for your fellow boba or coffee lovers on Birthday, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Anniversary, etc. Any issue with our item, just come to us for prompt solution. No question asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KMDZFa9yS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qinline","source_asin":"B0924NNBRB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0924NNBRB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0924NNBRB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
