window.products.push({"id":511136,"name":"Yuanshikj 2Pc (42\" Tall 12\" deep, 3/4\") Industrial Wall Mount Iron Pipe Shelf Shelves Shelving Bracket Vintage Retro Black DIY Open Bookshelf Storage ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7115IK9I9PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introduction: Hardware only，42\" tall, 3 Tier, 2pc 14 inch (without screw position) and 4pc 11\" inch (without screw position) for vertical combination ; depth 12\" (without screw position), a total of 6(and Flange combined to Wall) ; recommended to place the board less than or equal to 12 Inch width; 1\" pipe diameter; 8 Flange, 2 elbows, 4 tees, width can be customized according to their own ideas, but we do not recommend more than 60\"; Iron painted black matt; installation please Refer to our pic Sleek and elegant design. The black iron pipe 3/4 inch shelf hardware is an industrial-style decorative accessory that can be used to make floating wall shelves. Compared to L-shaped or triangular shelf brackets, black iron pipe shelf brackets are simpler and more generous and can blend perfectly with any furniture to show off your exquisite taste. Durable and sturdy material. The black iron pipe shelf bracket is made of high-quality iron material with anti-rust paint on its surface that can withstand items weighing up to 50 pounds. They also come with fixing tools to prevent shelves from slipping or shaking.The black iron 3/4 inch pipe shelf is a simple and elegant DIY home decor solution that adds a touch of industrial style to your walls. High space utilization rate. Black iron pipe shelf brackets can be used as wall brackets or clothes hangers. They are an ideal solution for increasing storage space when home space is limited, allowing you more space to display photos, souvenirs, succulents and other decorations. They are also suitable for hanging items in hallways, kitchens, bathrooms, bedrooms, closets, toilets, offices etc. Easy and quick installation. The black iron pipe shelf hardware includes a complete installation kit (including expansion tubes long screws short screws fixing tools) which can be easily installed on walls following instructions (wooden boards not included). Screws expansion tubes are very suitable stable ensuring perfect completion of your floating shelves.The black iron pipe 3/4 inch shelf hardware is both beautiful practical decorative accessory allowing you make unique industrial-style wall shelves yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7115IK9I9PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yuanshikj","source_asin":"B07GJ8WWH9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GJ8WWH9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GJ8WWH9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
