window.products.push({"id":511218,"name":"Gift Mark Rocking Chairs - Classic Wooden Rocker - Comfort Fitted Design Perfect for Living Rooms, Bedrooms, Nurserys, and More - Classic Vintage Styl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JW7iQkj+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gift Mark: Classic Wooden Rocking Chair (Cherry) The grace and charm of a classic wooden rocking chair is unmatched by other pieces. Nothing has the ability to draw people in with its warmth and comfort like a genuine wooden rocker with vintage style and comfortable design. These chairs make houses into homes and quiet nights into cozy evenings. It's the perfect piece to complete any bedroom, nursery, or living room. Experience the quality of a Gift Mark Rocking Chair. Simply Quality We include everything you need to make assembly fast and easy. Each box includes all of the parts and tools you need to put your chair together in minutes. Each chair uses real wood and is perfect for everything from reading to study time, lounge and TV time in the living room, enjoying indoors or outdoors on the porch, and much more! Give the Perfect Presents Our full-sized rocking chairs make the perfect gifts for any occasion! The full back and stately armrests are perfectly hand-made for your comfort and for the durability of the piece. It's a simple thing they'll use every day for years to come. These chairs make great gifts for birthdays, Christmas, holidays, Easter, house warmings, Mothers Day, Fathers Day, Valentines day, and more. They're great for moms, dads, family, coworkers, and friends. A rocker is the perfect addition to anyone's home. Check out our full selection of colors and chairs to find the best chairs for you! The Mark of Quality We like for the gifts we buy to be high quality. We like them to be wonderful things that are made to last, so every time the gift is used the recipient thinks of you. That's why we're called Gift Mark, we make pieces that are designed better, we hold ourselves to a higher standard of quality, design, and construction. Whether it's a gift, or it's for you make sure it has Gift Mark quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JW7iQkj+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gift Mark","source_asin":"B07BXS3LX3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BXS3LX3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BXS3LX3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
