window.products.push({"id":511296,"name":"Stein World Furniture Chesapeake Console Table, Cadet Grey, Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":389.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C-MkSzDSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Chesapeake Table is a beautiful console table in hand-painted sage gray finish with cream accents offering storage and classic design that will complement any décor style. Perfect for a beach or country cottage, this charming six-drawer console table features a classic silhouette with plenty of display and storage space. Featuring two different size drawers the four side drawers measure in at 9. 5” w x 7. 375” d x 2. 75” h and the middle drawers measure in at 8” w x 7. 375” d x 2. 25” h. The console includes six drawers that are ideal for keys, remote controls and other accessories. It’s vintage finish and decorative molding around ring pull hardware will bring a hint of casual elegance to your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C-MkSzDSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elk Home","source_asin":"B00JS11NEY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JS11NEY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JS11NEY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":511297,"name":"Childrens World Map by Michael Tompsett work, 22 by 32-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.33,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T6SF549eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a world map for children. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Athrough Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates urban landmark and cityscape designs.  Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T6SF549eL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00D3F4ZBE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D3F4ZBE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D3F4ZBE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
