window.products.push({"id":511340,"name":"sunssoon Neck Fan,Neck Fans Portable Rechargable Hands Free Bladeless Fan, 4000 mAh Battery 360 Degree Cooling Fan,3 Wind Speeds Adjustment LCD Displa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.81,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lrBW0hFsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Good Benefit function as following: FOR TRIPS:When you're trip,more convenient to carryon it, Hanging on the neck,cool and more comfortable,Feel cool anytime, anywhere,suitable for traveling in hot weather, save you from the embarrassment of dripping sweat suddenly in public in many places, it is your good assistant in summer. FOR WORK:When working, you can wear it while working and enjoying the cool windcan cool quickly in 1 seconds,Make your thoughts clear and energetic. FOR COOKING:Wearing it cooking in the kitchen in hot weather,bring you comfortable in summer to drive away troubles in hot weather,The neck fan really helped. The fan air was distinctly cooler than the outdoors, and the fan speeds were strong. FOR FITNESS/HIKING:When you are working out, you can also wear portable neck fan to bring you cool wind. Wingless design(no leaf hanging neck fan), you don't have to worry about hair being caught by fan blades specifications: Product name:Leafless hanging neck fan Digital display: 123 gear LCD display Product batteries: lithium batteries battery capacity;4000mAh Charging time: 14 hours Charging interface: USB Power:57power Running time:612 hours working temperature:840degree How to use: 1.Take out the fan,wear it around your neck with the air outlet facing up 2.Switch adjustment:Under power off stage,long press switch 3 seconds to turn on ,it is memory gear,one press is for wind speed is for wind speed adjustment,followed by recycling,123 gear can disply.long press switch 3 seconds to power off 3.Charging if the fan stop working at low power,please connect the power with charging cable to charge for fan indicator light flashing when charging ,always on once finished&turn off indicator lightPackage Contents: 1 x Neck Fan 1 x USB cable 1 x User manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lrBW0hFsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sunssoon","source_asin":"B096BF5YR3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096BF5YR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096BF5YR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":511341,"name":"Linen Store Quilted Reversible Microfiber Pet Dog Couch Furniture Protector Cover (Loveseat, Aqua/Navy)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lLzGpxKWL._AC_SL1382_.jpg","description":"Keeps stains and messes from your furniture and keeps your couch looking new with this quilted reversible microfiber furniture protector . This furniture protector is made of durable Microfiber fabric. It is reversible so you get two modern looks for the price of one. Machine washable.Available in Burgundy/Beige, Coffee/Tan, Sage/Tan, Aqua/Navy, Forest/Olive, Gray/Charcoal, Brown/Mocha and Black/GrayAvailable in 4 sizes:  Chair: 65\" x 71\" Love seat: 88\" x 71\" Sofa: 110\" x 71\" Recliner: 68\" x 79.5\" * Colors displayed in the pictures can be slightly off from the actual product, because of lighting and shading.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lLzGpxKWL._AC_SL1382_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linen Store","source_asin":"B0789HY4WX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0789HY4WX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0789HY4WX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":511342,"name":"Brief History of Art Coffee Mug - History's Greatest Masterpieces From Da Vinci to Koons - Comes in a Fun Gift Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XA7SIMynL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How much does it cost to go to a Fine Arts college? $20,000 a year? $30,000? What would you say if we offered you a comparable education for less than $15? Interested? Then read on! A crash course in the world's greatest art since the beginning of time. The 24 images on the mug represent the evolution of Western art over the millenia - from the cave paintings of Lascaux through Da Vinci and Degas and Picasso and all the way up to Jackson Pollock, Andy Warhol, and Jeff Koons. The bottom of the mug has detailed information on each of the works of art. So, not only does it give you a complete art history education, but you can also drink out of it. Try doing THAT with a diploma!Holds 14 oz / 400mL. Dishwasher and microwave safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XA7SIMynL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Unemployed Philosophers Guild","source_asin":"B0042PPUEA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511342","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0042PPUEA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0042PPUEA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
