window.products.push({"id":511344,"name":"Sink Caddy Kitchen Sink Organizer - Counter Top Rack Sponge Holder with Drip Tray for Dish Soap, Scrubber Brush, Stopper - Multiuse Kitchen Sink Acces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713iZ8nobCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size - 7.2\" L x 4\" W x 2.7\" H. Save more space and make the sink countertop clean and tidy. The idea size can hold various kitchen sink accessories tools, such as sponge, scrubbers, dish brush, hand or dish soap, sink stopper, etc Removable Drain Tray - The drain tray is easy to remove and put. It can prevent countertop from soap scum and water to keep table dry. Also, the sink caddy helps dry items faster via air flow. Anti-slip Design - The 4 feet of the sink caddy shelf are all equipped with anti-slip pads, which form strong friction with the table and will not slide at will. Also anti-slip rubbers can protect your table from scratches. Never Rust - The black sink sponge caddy is made of food-grade 304 stainless steel and anti-corrosive and rust-proof coating, which will never rust when used in wet environment long time. 100% Satisfied Service - The product includes 1 sink caddy rack and 1 plastic drain tray( brush or sponge not includes). Every caddy was tested by our professional staff before shipment. If you have any issue about the products you received,contact us and we will provide you with a satisfactory reply","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713iZ8nobCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VITEVER","source_asin":"B0BRX8RNRS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRX8RNRS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRX8RNRS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":511345,"name":"Avanti Linens Chalk it Up White and Black Ceramic Tissue Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NAEq2mJOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Avanti’s ceramic “Chalk it Up” facial tissue box cover is black and white on a fluted body, inspired by crafting with chalk and chalkboard paint/materials. The phrase “Soothe and Refresh” can be found on the side, mimicking the appearance of chalk on a blackboard. This facial tissue cover will add fun and whimsy to your decor. Let Avanti bring style and class to your home with the world’s largest bath accessory collection including decorative bath towels. This tissue holder is the perfect addition to your bath, kitchen, or home. This tissue holder features a white fluted body with a black “lid.” You can find matching accents from shower curtains to towels, bath rugs, paper towels, toothbrush holders, tumblers, and soap/lotion pumps/dispensers from Avanti to tie the whole look together. You can’t go wrong with this tissue cover if you are looking for classy elegance. This imported tissue dispenser cover will still look great on your bathroom vanity countertop with the decor that you already have. This item is not dishwasher safe. If your tissue box holder gets dirty, simply hand wash with water or a gentle cleanser made suitable for ceramic. Ensure that you are buying the proper size box of tissues as not all measure equally to fit into dispenser. Avanti’s tradition of excellence means any piece from this tissue box series will make a lasting impression. Founded in 1969, Avanti Linens has grown steadily to become a trusted and reliable brand. Now they offer a variety of bathroom sets and accessories, table linens, and kitchen textiles. Their decorative tissue box cover collection is carefully curated, designed, and constructed to ensure the highest quality pieces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NAEq2mJOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avanti Linens","source_asin":"B00L618EGO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L618EGO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L618EGO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
