window.products.push({"id":511366,"name":"Naava Moscow Mule Mugs - Authentic Russian Moscow Mule Gift Set of 2 Beautiful Artisan Hammered Copper Mugs PLUS Liquor Jigger - Unlined, Unlacquered ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ulQycuY9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOW REAL MOSCOW MULES ARE MADE Why Cold Copper is a Moscow MUST Be real. No one wants a lukewarm drink. Vodka on the rocks is classic for a reason. And moscow mules are icy. AND they come in copper mugs. It is a tradition. It tastes better. It stays colder. And it is just plain awesome. How to Make a Moscow Mule ½ oz lime juice 2oz vodka 2-3 ice cubes Fill with cold ginger beer Why Add a Liquor Jigger Bartending is an art. Perfect mix drinks mean great taste. That means exact shot measurements - awe guests with awesome moscow mules - bet they love your mugs too! No Better Gift Housewarming present, bachelor party, anniversary gift - it does not matter. Copper mugs create wow effect. Everyone enjoys an original, icy beverage - and the uniqueness of a real mule. Instructions Hand wash and dry after use Polish and remove copper tarnish with copper polish or salt/lemon mix Avoid chemical cleaners Do not use in dishwasher or microwave Naava - GREAT QUALITY. FAIR PRICES. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED BONUS! ORDER TODAY and for limited time get our Ultimate Bartender’s Guide - 15 Icy Moscow Mule Twists to Make Friends Jealous – FREE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ulQycuY9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Naava","source_asin":"B01H0EM0GA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H0EM0GA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H0EM0GA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
