window.products.push({"id":511427,"name":"VEVOR Commercial Food Mixer, 7.3Qt Capacity, 450W Dual Rotating Dough Kneading Machine with Food-grade Stainless Steel Bowl, Security Shield & Timer I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":600.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SzCE8JMuL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"key Features8L Mixing BowlThe 8L / 7.3Qt large capacity bowl can mix max. 3 kg / 6.6 lbs dough at one time. The mixing parts are all made of food-grade stainless steel with a neat appearance. With this premium material, easy cleaning and rust & corrosion-proof, it is durable and sturdy to use.Dual Rotation DesignThe mixing bowl and hook are specially-designed to rotate clockwise simultaneously with 21 r/min and 159 r/min speed. Because of this dual stirring system, the mixing effect is better than the ordinary ones.Powerful MotorOur dough mixer adopts a 450W motor with high performance and strong drive. It provides rapid and even dough mixing with low noise, ensuring a reliable long-term use.Simple to OperateThe waterproof power switch is effortless to use without drying hands frequently. The 60min time setting can precisely control the mixing time, meeting various mixing requirements. The reset button can solve most breakdown problems. The indicator light displays the work status.Security DetailsA secure shield can avoid accidental injuries. With the automatic shutdown function, this machine will stop immediately once the shield is opened or not closed tightly. The auxiliary rod makes the mixing process fully and steadily. The nonslip feet ensure the stability of this mixer.Wide ApplicationIt is suitable for home and commercial use, such as home kitchen, restaurant, bakery, pizzeria, breakfast shop, etc. And it is widely used in mixing doughs for making breads, pizzas, doughnuts, and noodles.SpecificationsModel: BDM8Power: 450WBowl Capacity: 8L / 7.3QtBowl & Hook Material: 304 Stainless SteelBowl Rotating Speed: 21 RPMHook Rotating Speed: 159 RPMBowl Dimensions: 10.2 x 10.2 x 5.9 inch Product Dimensions: 19.5 x 11.9 x 15.2 inchProduct Weight: 81.6 lbs / 37 kgPackage Content1 x Commercial Dough Mixer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SzCE8JMuL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B0B6Q1TWCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6Q1TWCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6Q1TWCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
