window.products.push({"id":511441,"name":"S-DEAL 36 Inches Christmas Tree Skirt Black and White Plaid Buffalo Double Layers Checked Deco for Holiday Party Mat Xmas Ornaments","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711w7yrUIPL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"DOUBLE LAYERS FABRIC DESIGN - The Christmas tree skirt is made of high quality polyester fabric. This lattice tree skirt has exquisite craftsmanship and traditional double-decker design. It is a thick, comfortable and soft carpet. The mat can be used for many years. It is different from other cheap materials. BLACK AND WHITE GRID - The black and white traditional plaid design is suitable for different styles of home decoration. The white backing is just as pretty and useful as the buffalo plaid pattern. Its materials and colors match any kind of wooden or tile floor. GORGEOUS XMAS DECOR - Our farmhouse plaid tree skirt gives your tree all the charm of a countryside Christmas. Featuring our exclusive plaid pattern in white and black, this tree skirt is finished with a rich color for added warmth. Pair it with our stocking for a beautiful, rustic display. EASY TO INSTALL AND PROTECT YOUR HOME - Three invisible magic tapes make it easier to use, so it can be turned on or off. The blanket is easily secured without having to bend over to tie several strings. A tree skirt can help keep your home clean by collecting the needles that fall from a genuine pine tree, and which will invariably end up spread all around the house if not properly caught and collected. HOLIDAY DECORATION - Featuring a concentric circular design, it is a simple yet sophisticated adornment for your Christmas tree. The lovely Christmas colors and designs, durable cotton / polyester blend, are ideal for most families. It is an absolutely gorgeous Christmas tree skirt, and so very well made and completely matches the decor or your home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711w7yrUIPL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S-DEAL","source_asin":"B09X5BVRCZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X5BVRCZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X5BVRCZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
