window.products.push({"id":511664,"name":"Milk Frother Handheld, Electric Foam Maker for Coffee USB Rechargeable Immersion Blender Cordlesss 3 Speeds Mini Milk Foamer Drink Mixer with Double W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DfCboC+AL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"High Quality Milk Frother - The detachable whisking head is made of food grade premium stainless steel, easy to clean. The frother wand is made of food grade ABS with easy and comfortable grip. The built-in powerful low-noise motor brings strengthened speed rotation without disturbing your families and gives you a calm and tranquil morning Professional Kitchen & Barista Tool - There are 2 replaceable versatile whisks available. Choose the spring whisking head to make the perfect milk foam for your morning & afternoon coffee. And the ballon whisking head help you beat eggs & fluffy whipped cream. USB Rechargeable Milk Frother - The handheld milk frother is powered by the built-in 1200mAh rechargeable lithium battery, without battery replacement, eco-friendly and saving your money. It also comes with a Android USB Cable, a fully charged takes 3 hours, convenient in daily use. 3 Speeds Adjustable Coffee Frother - Press the on/off switch to make the coffee frother work with blue light. Continue to press the on/off button, the speed will switch between low speed, medium speed and high speed. You could choose different speeds to achieve ideal frother effect. Note: please to use it in a tall bottle or deeper container to avoid splattered coffee or milk because of frother's strong motor! Perfect Gift - The milk frother provides you with a rich creamy foam, just like a professional barista. You can give it to your friends and family. Let them enjoy the convenience and fun of making chocolate or cappuccino at home. Enjoy the elegance, simplicity and flavor of a rich bubble drink anytime, anywhere. Perfect for using in home, office, camping, or travel.The wand can be turned upside down on the countertop, Easy to place anywhere.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DfCboC+AL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AM CALMPLE","source_asin":"B0C579NYX3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C579NYX3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C579NYX3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
