window.products.push({"id":511741,"name":"ZenBless Ceramic Lotus Incense Stick Holder Waterfall Burner Lotus Ash Catcher Tray Handmade Home Decor for Indoor Yoga Meditation","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6153Z7yZoBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorative Lotus Design: Lotus is the symbol of purity and elegance in oriental culture. A beautiful lotus sitting in the center of the lily pad looks very harmonious and natural. It will be a great decoration for your room and a great gift for those that like incense. Easy to Clean: Made of high-quality porcelain clay, hand-shaped, fired at high temperature, the ceramic surface of the lotus leaf is fine and smooth. Non-sticky ash, look always like the new! Come with a brush, It makes them very easy to be cleaned. The included tweezers keep our hands clean and free from scent residue. Great Ash Catcher: There is a round hole in the center of the little lotus pod. Stick incense can be inserted, deep enough and heavy enough to make them stand sturdily. The angle of the hole in the lotus pod is slightly inclined towards the middle of the lotus leaf, which makes the ash fall perfectly on the plate. One Holder Three Usages: This incense holder can be used with stick incense, coil incense, and backflow incense cones. The package includes a gourd incense holder as a gift, you can put coil incense on it. The lotus leaf tray is enough big to catch the ash of coil incense. Wide Applicable Scene: Zenbless incense holder burner is not only suitable for home, office, and hotel, but also for yoga practice, zen practice, and meditation. We strive to inspire your spiritual practice by providing various quality meditation supplies. There are lots of reasons to burn some incense, specific scents can trigger some pretty comforting, happy thoughts and encourage relaxation, increase motivation, and stimulate creativity.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6153Z7yZoBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZenBless","source_asin":"B0BTY8HQ8M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTY8HQ8M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTY8HQ8M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
