window.products.push({"id":511916,"name":"Boryard 2-Piece Twin Quilt Set, Lightweight Soft Full Size Quilt Bedspread Coverlet (68x86 inches) Bedding Set with 1 Pillow Shams (20x26 inches), Pai","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91T6zXFgxmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester ☛DURABLE, SOFT, LUXURIOUS - The quilt sets adopt ultrasonic technology to weld and stitch the fabric together without needle and thread, extremely sturdy and durable; Made of 100% polyester microfiber, the material is soft and velvety to touch, offer luxurious comfort for sleeping ☛MULTI-PURPOSE COMFORTER & REVERSIBLE - The lightweight comforter set is suitable for master bedroom, guest room, dormitory, daybed bedding, sofa, camping and so on, can be used as summer blanket when air conditioner is on in the evening, bed cover, coverlet and bedspread on spring, autumn, winter, also as a protective cover for your bed or leather couch. The comforter is reversible so you can change your bedroom style in a snap. ☛PAISLEY PRINT DESIGN & ATTRACTIVE, LIGHTWEIGHT - The quilt set features a chic paisley pattern to add classical visual appeal to any bedroom; Lightweight to be used on their own even on a warm summer night, and great for adding an extra layer of coziness when things get chilly. ☛TWIN/ FULL QUEEN/ KING SIZE QUILT SETS - We provide sizes of King and Queen bed comforter sets. King(104” x 90” quilt with 2pcs 20” x 26” shams), Queen(90” x 90” with 2pcs 20” x 36” pillow covers), Twin(68\" x 86\" quilt with 1pcs 20\"x 26\" pillow shams)) bedding set. Please note that the bed sheet is not included. ☛CHOOSE THE PRINTING YOU LIKE & WARRANTY - The quilt sets are available in leaf print, floral print, paisley print and rose print. Machine wash cold, gentle cycle and air dry. No Iron. We provide 3-month warranty for our quilt. Please feel free to contact us if there is any concern when you receive the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91T6zXFgxmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boryard","source_asin":"B09WDLNMJM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-511916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WDLNMJM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WDLNMJM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
